# Todo List Application with Zustand

## Overview
This project is a simple Todo List application built with **React** and **Zustand** for state management. It demonstrates how Zustand can simplify state handling compared to prop drilling or Context, and includes persistence using localStorage.

## Features
- Add new todos
- Toggle todos as completed or not
- Delete individual todos
- Clear all completed todos
- Persistent storage with localStorage

## Project Setup
1. Create a new Vite React project:
   ```bash
   npx create-vite@latest todo-zustand
   cd todo-zustand
   npm install
   npm install zustand

src/
  components/
    TodoInput.jsx
    TodoItem.jsx
    TodoList.jsx
  store/
    todoStore.js
  App.jsx
  main.jsx

npm run dev

